{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「冷死了——\\n　差不多快到必须穿大衣的季节了啊——」", "text_idx": 183, "plain": "「冷死了——　差不多快到必须穿大衣的季节了啊——」", "plain_idx": 184, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1549", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「时间过得真快。\\n　十一月都已经过了一半了」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": "「时间过得真快。　十一月都已经过了一半了」", "plain_idx": 187, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾你啊，\\n　也差不多该找个\\n　能一起互相取暖的可爱女朋友了吧～？」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": "「新吾你啊，　也差不多该找个　能一起互相取暖的可爱女朋友了吧～？」", "plain_idx": 189, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1550", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那边的两位，这样可不行哦。\\n　老师可不允许学生们做这么不要脸的事」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": "「那边的两位，这样可不行哦。　老师可不允许学生们做这么不要脸的事」", "plain_idx": 192, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mc0467", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只不过，如果对方也到了合适的年龄的话，\\n　倒也不是……不行」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": "「只不过，如果对方也到了合适的年龄的话，　倒也不是……不行」", "plain_idx": 196, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mc0468", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜哇——吓我一跳」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1551", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「刚才到底是在哪啊。突然就冒出来了……」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁也是像那样经常神出鬼没的呢。\\n　……话说新吾，这该怎么处理」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": "「安洁也是像那样经常神出鬼没的呢。　……话说新吾，这该怎么处理」", "plain_idx": 202, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1552", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那要不就适当回应一下她好了」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「了解，新吾。开始吧」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1553", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果我们能找到像老师一样完美的女性的话，\\n　这个冬天肯定就不会感到寒冷了吧」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": "「如果我们能找到像老师一样完美的女性的话，　这个冬天肯定就不会感到寒冷了吧」", "plain_idx": 208, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀，新吾你呀。\\n　不用这么恭维我也行的」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": "「哎呀，新吾你呀。　不用这么恭维我也行的」", "plain_idx": 210, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mc0469", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……你管这叫适当回应一下？」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1554", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「她的眼睛都闪闪发光了」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯唔，真不愧是新吾同学呢。\\n　您就是用那样的话语\\n　让世界上的妇女们误入歧途的吗？」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": "「嗯唔，真不愧是新吾同学呢。　您就是用那样的话语　让世界上的妇女们误入歧途的吗？」", "plain_idx": 217, "len": 45, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3846", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么都好了啦，话说你是从哪儿冒出来的」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6301", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我戳」", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5165", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呀啊？！吓我一跳，怎么连樱乃你也——」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6302", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是从地板下出来的」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5166", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「地板下面？！难道说这里\\n　还有我安洁不知道的密道吗！」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": "「地板下面？！难道说这里　还有我安洁不知道的密道吗！」", "plain_idx": 231, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3847", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「拜托你们俩之后的出场方式能不能正常一点。\\n　可别再从天花板或者地板之类的地方出现了……」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": "「拜托你们俩之后的出场方式能不能正常一点。　可别再从天花板或者地板之类的地方出现了……」", "plain_idx": 234, "len": 46, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6303", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱纱的班级无论什么时候来都这么热闹呢——」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu2882", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「各务台学院的男生来了之后就一直是这样了。\\n　唉，真是怀恋之前的女校生活……」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": "「各务台学院的男生来了之后就一直是这样了。　唉，真是怀恋之前的女校生活……」", "plain_idx": 242, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2659", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有男生在就是不一样呢」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu2883", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「比如说？」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2660", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「像是班级的氛围，还有学院整体的感觉都变了。\\n　纱纱不这么觉得吗？」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": "「像是班级的氛围，还有学院整体的感觉都变了。　纱纱不这么觉得吗？」", "plain_idx": 249, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu2884", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这个嘛……」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2661", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「居然就这样夺走了我们两人的心，老师你真是个罪恶的女性呢」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1555", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么这样，要我在两人之中选一个，我实在是做不到……」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mc0470", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊，这种时候该怎么办才好……\\n　不，不行，万智，不能让可爱的学生迷上你自己」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": "「啊啊，这种时候该怎么办才好……　不，不行，万智，不能让可爱的学生迷上你自己」", "plain_idx": 258, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mc0471", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是但是，如果真的要从中选一个的话……」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mc0472", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……新吾，我能跑吗？」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1556", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「谁让你刚刚说那种火上浇油的话啊？」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀，怎么说呢，就感觉刚才的气氛不说都不行」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1557", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「完了，眼睛真的在闪闪发光了」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真耀眼啊」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1558", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……男生真是垃圾」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2662", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵。要是被新吾说了那种话，\\n　肯定会心跳加速呢」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": "「呵呵。要是被新吾说了那种话，　肯定会心跳加速呢」", "plain_idx": 273, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu2885", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是吗？我肯定只会感到恶心」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2663", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "放学后——", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "正当我一如平常地往活动室走的时候，\\n看到了纱凪的身影。", "text_idx": 278, "plain": "正当我一如平常地往活动室走的时候，看到了纱凪的身影。", "plain_idx": 279, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……纱凪吗。和她关系还不是很好，不是很适合打照面。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只不过我也必须得早点适应才行呢。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱凪同学」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……你是故意来惹我生气的吗」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2664", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，不对。纱凪，我是说纱凪」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可别让我再说第二次」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2665", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽说是同级生，但要我直接叫名字还是有点不习惯啊。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「接下来是要去活动室吗？」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，是这样没错……」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2666", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪一边含糊地回答我，\\n一边往周围看来看去。", "text_idx": 292, "plain": "纱凪一边含糊地回答我，一边往周围看来看去。", "plain_idx": 293, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在找东西吗？」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「和你没关系」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2667", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果是要找东西的话，一起来会比较快哦」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
